            "review_title": "Review at Kaiba",
            "review_text": "Lê Thái\nHanoi, Vietnam4 contributions\n0\nJapanese standard restaurant in Hanoi\nMar 2024 • Friends\nThe restaurant is located on the rooftop of the office building. The space is spacious and airy, with a super beautiful garden. The food is authentic Japanese. Diverse menu. There is a delicious puffer fish dish here, but you have to order it in advance. If you come and not order in advance, it won't be enough. I recommend Ozaki beef. The staff introduced it as a premium beef. The meat is tender and juicy and delicious. Attentive service, extremely thoughtful hostess. In general, this is my favorite restaurant and I always recommend it to friends and partners.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten April 11, 2024",
            "rating": 4.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
