            "review_title": "Review at Kaiba",
            "review_text": "Marvin H\nZurich, Switzerland6 contributions\n1\nExtraordinary dinner experience\nNov 2019 • Couples\nI was here with my girlfriend on the last evening of our stay in Hanoi and wanted to get something special (we've had enough Phô at this point). Upon entering we immediately felt welcome and were treated with a great view over this part of the city. The experience was absolutely authentic, the food was delicious and the service superb! \nThe prices are high, as someone living in Switzerland I felt like I was back there, but quality has its price and it was well worth it.\nRead more\nWritten November 13, 2019",
