            "review_title": "Review at Kaiba",
            "review_text": "Luckyinchina\nHanoi, Vietnam66 contributions\n0\nGreat quality sushi\nMar 2019 • Couples\nTucked away on the top floor of an office building so not so easy to find, but well worth it. Fantastic quality sushi and a lovely outdoor terrace. Unfortunately not so easy for tourists as no English menu is available at this point (the menus are in Japanese and Vietnamese only) but all food seems amazing, and - we are told by our Japanse friends - very authentic, so if you are open for a bit of experimentation this is a great spot! It is not cheap which is fine given the high quality of ingredients. Otherwise for less adventorous guests, the lunch sets are pretty straightforward and a great value.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 13, 2019",
